  "description": "Uncalibrated length-temperature schematic: two horizontal and two vertical dashed guides, zero origin, l_0/l and t_0/t labels. One positive straight line begins at the reference pair and continues past the later pair to the printed finite unlabelled end. No line to the origin, added endpoint marker or material coefficient calibration.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9p/figures/fig-99.png",
      "sha256": "03c34033d6a15267bd8292f03b0db7b1d273d4afd865aff7a00f62d1ef3d3cd6"
